Important: to use this port, you have to pass
-Djava.library.path="%%LOCALBASE%%/lib"
for JCEF to find the jogamp-jogl libraries.

It is also important to pass these parameters:
    --add-exports java.desktop/sun.awt=ALL-UNNAMED
    --add-exports java.desktop/sun.java2d=ALL-UNNAMED
    --add-exports java.base/java.lang=ALL-UNNAMED
because sun.awt is required.

As an example see %%DATADIR%%/run.sh.
